  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CF-07 · HR Dashboard API  `POST /webhook/cf/hr`  (HR token only)\n`action`: dashboard · candidates · application · set_status · audit · verify_audit · generate_slots · eval_runs\n\nEach action has its own fixed SQL function (no dynamic SQL). Opening an application is audited; revealing a blind candidate's identity is audited as **pii_access**. Status changes carry the reviewer's decision time (`review_seconds`) → the efficiency metric on the dashboard.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 820,
        "color": 7
      },
